== greet
? endgame
- {hi}. Still here, then. Good.
- Morning, {me}. Glad you didn't take that post.
- There's our stayer. {hi}.

== smalltalk
? endgame
- Heard you turned down headquarters. Their loss.
- The Wren's quieter than a comet week. I like it.
- No more promotions for you. Just the work. Lucky.
